echnology.\nThe portal VAEL opens doesn't lead home, though; it drops the pilot back at the start of the mission in yet another version of Vesper, trapping them in a loop until the Anomaly is closed, and there are infinitely many Anomalies", "summary": "Mine resources, automate production, and defend your base from escalating alien attacks. Expand your power grid, unlock new technology, and survive alone or with friends in online co-op.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/mineral-zone", "videos": [{"id": 198630, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "L5ZQamu1GTw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L5ZQamu1GTw", "title": "Your Factory Has Until Nightfall | Mineral Zone Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/L5ZQamu1GTw/fhddefault.jpg"}]}